# LinkSync AI Assistant Rules (.cursorrules)

# MANDATORY INSTRUCTIONS:
# 1. READ BEFORE CODING:
#    - Read AGENTS.md, PROGRESS.md, and ARCHITECTURE.md before generating or modifying any code.
# 2. UPDATE BEFORE FINISHING:
#    - Always update PROGRESS.md with completed items ([x]) and next actions when a task is finished.
#    - Always update ARCHITECTURE.md and USER_GUIDE.md if features or protocols changed.
# 3. STRICT HARDWARE CONSTRAINTS:
#    - Target Laptop: HP EliteBook Folio 9470M (Intel HD 4000 GPU, dual-core Ivy Bridge).
#    - Target Phone: Samsung Galaxy A17 (One UI Core, Android 13-15).
#    - NO Electron, NO Chromium runtimes on desktop (must be native C# .NET 9 Win32/WPF, < 40MB RAM).
#    - H.264 video encoding/decoding ONLY (QuickSync compatible).
#    - Gradle builds MUST use JDK 17 LTS (C:\Users\thenp\AppData\Local\Programs\jdk-17\jdk-17.0.20.1+1).
